(
K11 (2026-10-06): the nodal total strain is recovered with the same
operator as the stress (the Professional per-element least-squares fit;
bilinear interpolation of the 2x2 Gauss values for quad4). Two quad4,
E 1, nu 0.3, left edge clamped, right edge pulled 1e-3. On the clamped
edge uy = 0, so eptyy(node 1) = 0 exactly; eptxy(1) 6.44824708e-5,
eptyy(2) -2.57929883e-4 (= Professional 02-08-2026). GNU before K11
(h-weighted average): eptyy(1) -8.59766e-5, eptxy(1) 2.14942e-5,
eptyy(2) -2.07012e-4. The stress is unchanged.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 0 1
node 5 1 1
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 4 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_time 0 0 0 1 0
bounda_dof 1 -ra 3 6 -ra -velx
bounda_time 1 0 0 1 1.e-3
control_timestep 0 1 1

target_item 0 -node_dof 1 -eptyy
target_value 0 0. 1.e-12
target_item 1 -node_dof 1 -eptxy
target_value 1 6.44824708e-05 1.e-12
target_item 2 -node_dof 2 -eptyy
target_value 2 -2.57929883e-04 1.e-12
target_item 3 -node_dof 1 -sigxx
target_value 3 6.42737896e-04 1.e-12
end_data
